{"ts":"2026-09-15T21:47:46.700Z","tool":"execute_code","type":"tool","status":"SUCCESS","ms":275,"action":"execute","params":{"action":"execute","code":"var cam = UnityEngine.Camera.main;\nif (cam == null) return \"NO MAIN CAMERA\";\nint w=320, h=180;\nvar rt = new UnityEngine.RenderTexture(w,h,24);\ncam.targetTexture = rt;\ncam.Render();\nUnityEngine.RenderTexture.active = rt;\nvar tex = new UnityEngine.Texture2D(w,h,UnityEngine.TextureFormat.RGB24,false);\ntex.ReadPixels(new UnityEngine.Rect(0,0,w,h),0,0);\ntex.Apply();\ncam.targetTexture = null;\nUnityEngine.RenderTexture.active = null;\nvar cs = tex.GetPixels();\nint pink=0, black=0, nonblack=0; float r=0,g=0,b=0;\nforeach (var c in cs){ r+=c.r; g+=c.g; b+=c.b; if(c.r>0.8f&&c.b>0.8f&&c.g<0.4f) pink++; if(c.r<0.05f&&c.g<0.05f&&c.b<0.05f) black++; if(c.r>0.02f||c.g>0.02f||c.b>0.02f) nonblack++; }\nint n=cs.Length;\nUnityEngine.Object.DestroyImmediate(tex);\nUnityEngine.Object.DestroyImmediate(rt);\nreturn \"px=\"+n+\" avg r=\"+(r/n).ToString(\"F3\")+\" g=\"+(g/n).ToString(\"F3\")+\" b=\"+(b/n).ToString(\"F3\")+\" | pink=\"+pink+\"(\"+(100f*pink/n).ToString(\"F1\")+\"%) black=\"+black+\"(\"+(100f*black/n).ToString(\"F1\")+\"%) nonblack=\"+nonblack+\"(\"+(100f*nonblack/n).ToString(\"F1\")+\"%)\";","safety_checks":true,"compiler":"auto"}}
