{"ts":"2026-09-15T21:48:33.021Z","tool":"execute_code","type":"tool","status":"SUCCESS","ms":305,"action":"execute","params":{"action":"execute","code":"var cam = UnityEngine.Camera.main;\nint w=320, h=180;\nvar rt = new UnityEngine.RenderTexture(w,h,24);\ncam.targetTexture = rt;\ncam.Render();\nUnityEngine.RenderTexture.active = rt;\nvar tex = new UnityEngine.Texture2D(w,h,UnityEngine.TextureFormat.RGB24,false);\ntex.ReadPixels(new UnityEngine.Rect(0,0,w,h),0,0);\ntex.Apply();\ncam.targetTexture = null;\nUnityEngine.RenderTexture.active = null;\nvar cs = tex.GetPixels();\nfloat minL=1f; int minX=0,minY=0; float maxL=0f;\nfor(int y=0;y<h;y++) for(int x=0;x<w;x++){ var c=cs[y*w+x]; float l=(c.r+c.g+c.b)/3f; if(l<minL){minL=l;minX=x;minY=y;} if(l>maxL)maxL=l; }\n// 9宫格平均亮度\nvar sb=new System.Text.StringBuilder();\nsb.AppendLine(\"minL=\"+minL.ToString(\"F3\")+\" at (\"+minX+\",\"+minY+\")  maxL=\"+maxL.ToString(\"F3\"));\nfor(int gy=0;gy<3;gy++){\n  var row=new System.Text.StringBuilder();\n  for(int gx=0;gx<3;gx++){\n    float sum=0; int cnt=0;\n    for(int y=gy*h/3;y<(gy+1)*h/3;y++) for(int x=gx*w/3;x<(gx+1)*w/3;x++){ sum+=(cs[y*w+x].r+cs[y*w+x].g+cs[y*w+x].b)/3f; cnt++; }\n    row.Append((sum/cnt).ToString(\"F2\")+\" \");\n  }\n  sb.AppendLine(row.ToString());\n}\nUnityEngine.Object.DestroyImmediate(tex);\nUnityEngine.Object.DestroyImmediate(rt);\nreturn sb.ToString();","safety_checks":true,"compiler":"auto"}}
